"served:self_challenge.strategy_flow","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶斷句 ⭢❷找動詞/形容詞 ⭢❸找/補主語 ⭢❹用自己的話說一說","n":32,"ssz":"................................"},{"section":"served:self_challenge.annotations[0].term","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"路","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.annotations[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"宋代地方行政單位，層級由高至低為路、州、縣。","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:self_challenge.annotations[1].term","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"監司","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.annotations[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"監察地方屬吏的職官。","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.annotations[2].term","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"呂夷簡","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.annotations[2].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"宋仁宗時的宰相。","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:self_challenge.translation","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"馬亮很會看人，當時他是夔路監司，呂夷簡的父親是州職官(依注釋可知，馬亮是呂父的長官)。馬亮初見呂夷簡，就把女兒許配給他。他的妻子生氣地說：｢您曾說要讓女兒成為國公夫人，為何把女兒嫁給這個人的兒子?｣馬亮說：｢這就是讓女兒成為國公夫人的辦法。｣","n":121,"ssz":".......................................1.................1.....1..1.................1.......1...1........................"},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items[0].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（一）","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items[0].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請依照故事脈絡，回答下列問題。","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items[0].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"橘色手寫（在文字層），PDF p10 可見","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items[0].questions[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據斷句後的第一個分句，主語是誰？","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items[0].questions[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"馬亮","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items[0].questions[1].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"承上題，這個主語怎麼樣或做什麼？","n":16,"ssz":".....1.........."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items[0].questions[1].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他很會相人/他是夔路監司","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items[0].questions[2].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這個分句還有另一個人物，他叫什麼名字？","n":19,"ssz":".1......1........1."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items[0].questions[3].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"承上題，這個人怎麼樣或做什麼？","n":15,"ssz":".....1........."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items[0].questions[3].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他的爸爸是州職官","n":8,"ssz":"...1...."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items[0].questions[4].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據這個分句出現的人物，誰「一見夷簡，即許以女嫁之」？(補主語)","n":32,"ssz":"...1..........1................."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.quiz.label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（二）閱讀理解測驗","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.quiz.questions[0].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據這段文字，下列敘述何者最恰當？","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.quiz.questions[0].options.A","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"馬亮預見呂夷簡將來必身居朝廷要職","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:self_challenge.quiz.questions[0].options.B","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"馬亮與呂父有私交，故結為兒女親家","n":16,"ssz":"..............1."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.quiz.questions[0].options.C","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"馬亮之妻希望女兒嫁入國夫人的家中","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:self_challenge.quiz.questions[0].options.D","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"馬亮為了升官，把女兒許配給呂夷簡","n":16,"ssz":"..1.........1..."},{"section":"served:intro_guide.label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"導讀：","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:intro_guide.text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一篇好的故事要有讓人印象深刻的「賣點」，會讓人瞪大雙眼，問說：「這有可能嗎？」底下這篇用古文寫的故事，講到兩個朋友之間約了兩年後在家裡吃飯，時間到了，相隔500公里的朋友會準時出現嗎？古時候，交通非常不便，沒有公車、火車，遠距溝通的電話、網路更是不可能。兩年沒有聯絡，連媽媽都在懷疑：「你的朋友到底會不會來啊？」結果，朋友真的準時出現了。這種信守承諾的故事非常難得，因此被流傳到今天。","n":192,"ssz":"......................................................1....................1........................1...................................1.............1........................................."},{"section":"served:goal_box.文言聚光燈","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文言聚光燈：判斷句","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:goal_box.level_badge","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"記敘人物","n":4,"ssz":"...."}]}
